---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><meta name="description" content="Inspect a recorded real AI answer against its supplied evidence. No model download needed."/><meta name="theme-color" content="#102a34"/><title>Source Trail — Does the evidence agree?</title><link rel="icon" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}favicon.svg`} type="image/svg+xml"/></head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#lab">Skip to Story Lab</a><StoryLab client:load/><noscript>Enable JavaScript for the interactive lab.</noscript></body></html>
